    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your stand can Scout or Search for your group from up to 60 feet ahead (anywhere in its range for a long-range stand) while you travel with the group. Scouting gives the usual +1 circumstance bonus to initiative. When it Searches, the GM rolls your secret Seek check from the stand's space. If the group walks into a hazard or ambush the stand was searching for, the stand triggers it first and takes its effect instead of the first creature in line.</p>",
